# Abscissas x and weights w for Gauss-Legendre quadrature for all orders <=64.
#
# The data have been obtained by converting the two php files provided at
# https://pomax.github.io/bezierinfo/legendre-gauss.html. For each order n 
# the data have been written using the Python code
#
#     fdat.write(f'{n}\n')
#     for i in range(0, n, 2):
#         fdat.write(f'{abs(x[i]):20.18f} {w[i]:20.18f}\n')
#
# For each nonzero abscissa x there is another abscissa -x with the same weight.
#
# Note that the last two digits of the numbers may be numerical noise.
#
